    "gp_section_609881851238023753": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "fc2fec9b8555db31779838c090b75bda73c5e0438ece3f9b87d373beb7710389_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg0A4rcr-fr_childItem_0": "<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee</p>",
        "gg3Tpea_Vgu_text": "<p>Then we don’t want your money. Use the entire pouch (or even empty it) and email us within 90 days. We’ll refund every penny — no questions, no restocking fees, and we even cover return shipping. Over 12,847 customers have trusted this promise</p>",
        "gg3cuQ_KEBg_text": "<p>No. Because we use pure creatine monohydrate (not cheap fillers) and test every batch after cooking, bloating is extremely rare. The small 3-gummy serving + Panax Ginseng actually helps digestion for most people. If you ever feel anything off in the first 90 days, we refund you instantly.</p>",
        "gg4jL4jSvFN_text": "<p>FusiForce is the first clean creatine gummy that really works.</p>",
        "gg4wATit1L2_text": "<p>Most people notice better workouts and mental clarity in 7–14 days. Full strength and recovery benefits hit around week 3–4. That’s exactly why we recommend the 2-pouch Performance Pack — it gives you a full 60-day trial so you can feel the difference risk-free.</p>",
        "gg5IlB3Ur2V_text": "<p>Every single batch is tested by an ISO 17025 accredited lab after cooking. We publish the full COA right here [add downloadable PDF button]. No other gummy brand shows you post-cooking results. That’s why 8 of the top 10 Amazon brands failed independent tests — we refused to play that game</p>",
        "ggAxhA3Uj70_childItem_0": "<p>Over 137,235+ Happy Customers</p>",
        "ggH8SXdz9CD_text": "<p>It took us 2 years to solve the melting problem. Each 3-gummy serving is pre-portioned and protected. Toss one in your gym bag without a container. No sticky mess.</p>",
        "ggSt8yDooVd_childItem_0": "<p>FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70</p>",
        "ggdnaAmEzTd_text": "<p>While other brands test their powder before cooking (then destroy the creatine with heat), we test the finished gummies after cooking — and publish the lab reports. Our founder spent 10 months perfecting every detail, personally audited 50+ manufacturers, and is the only one willing to take full accountability. Result? 5,000 mg of real, verified creatine in just 3 gummies. Most customers who switched from Amazon brands say it’s the first time they actually felt the difference</p>",
        "ggiCNWSVN2p_text": "<p>Yes — 100% safe for women. Many of our customers in perimenopause or menopause use it daily for mental clarity, energy, and recovery (not just muscle). The clinical 5g dose works the same for everyone. Start with 3 gummies per day — you’ll feel sharper within 2–3 weeks</p>",
        "ggjbLSPwRKc_text": "<strong>Any Last </strong><span style=\"background-color:rgba(189,229,34,0.77);\"><i><strong>Questions?</strong></i></span>",
        "ggmyeDM8vjW_label": "<p>TRY FUSIFORCE TODAY!</p>",
        "ggpY_pM_m34_childItem_0": "<p>How is FusiForce different from other creatine gummies?</p>",
        "ggpY_pM_m34_childItem_1": "<p>Can women take FusiForce Creatine Gummies?</p>",
        "ggpY_pM_m34_childItem_2": "<p>Is FusiForce third-party tested and verified for purity?</p>",
        "ggpY_pM_m34_childItem_3": "<p>Why pouches with individual serving bags?</p>",
        "ggpY_pM_m34_childItem_4": "<p>How long until I see results?</p>",
        "ggpY_pM_m34_childItem_5": "<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>",
        "ggpY_pM_m34_childItem_6": "<p>Will FusiForce cause bloating or stomach issues?</p>",
        "ggyM9ZhgXJs_childItem_0": "<p>24/7 Customer Service</p>"
