        "checksum": "cb4a13da582747e29a89a5f6da99a11972525af72dc307517e2d90cdd5e5e6fc_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg09TgkxHis_text": "<p>Avoided creatine for YEARS because influencers made it sound like one gummy = instant She-Hulk. Spoiler: that's not how anything works. Three months on FusiForce: same 5'2\". Not bulky. But I can carry ALL my groceries in one trip now. <strong>Like a CHAMPION.</strong></p>",
