        "ggEMuHEUmn4_text": "<p><strong>I did the math and now I'm actually mad.&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggEvJH-nEjB_text": "<p>Okay so I'm the idiot who spent $847 on PUSH gummies over 14 months. BIOAVAILABILITY OF WHAT?? CORN SYRUP??? Anyway I've been taking FusiForce for 6 weeks and my bench is up 15lbs.</p>",
        "ggG90ezrUJt_text": "<p>Gary does curls in the squat rack. I looked him dead in his eyes and said \"nothing really, just genetics I guess.\" GARY LOOKED SO DEFEATED.</p>",
