        "gghT0Du_cek_text": "<p><strong>— Michelle T., 42, Denver CO ✓</strong></p>",
        "gghfYuVsohf_text": "<p><strong>I accidentally started a cult at my office</strong></p>",
        "ggibe0BHD_L_text": "<p><strong>14 months of expensive candy</strong></p>",
        "ggikw4EA7gm_text": "<p>We were supposed to discuss \"Lessons in Chemistry.\" Instead I gave a PowerPoint on creatine. Six weeks later, 7 members take FusiForce. We have a group chat called \"Creatine Queens.\" <strong>Karen hit 135lbs on squat. KAREN IS 54. WE CRIED.</strong></p>",
        "ggjjaIjnjvm_text": "<p><strong>— Emma L., 29, Seattle WA ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggjt70teJIi_text": "<p><strong>Switched from Amazon fakes. I paid $55 for literal candy</strong></p>",
        "ggkmRb3v12d_text": "<p><strong>My trainer roasted me so hard I switched careers. Jk but almost.</strong></p>",
        "ggnZgO5qRJp_text": "<p><strong>— Tyler B., 28, San Francisco CA ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggsS-nUjqhO_text": "<p>KAREN DOESN'T EVEN WORK OUT. It's been 6 weeks. I have converted 11 coworkers to FusiForce. We have a Slack channel called #gummygang. IT flagged it.</p>",
        "ggvTH7KCDFd_childItem_0": "<p>Over 137,235+ Happy Customers</p>",
        "ggzUKmMpCOJ_text": "<p>I trusted influencers. Bought what they promoted. Defended it to my gym friends. \"You don't understand bioavailability!\" Then the testing came out. <strong>ZERO creatine.</strong> I wasn't a non-responder. I was a scam victim. FusiForce shows their lab reports. My deadlift is up 25lbs. My trust in influencers is gone forever.</p>"
      },
